      "m_dialogList": {
        "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
        "m_dialogs": [
          {
            "m_dialogTag": "Completion",
            "m_dialogEntries": [
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001-B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "This used to be a proper school of Shadow Magic. Even had a spell tree. Bartleby and Raven tried to suppress it, but where there's light...",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-BLACK_092.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001-B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Shadow Magic is just a natural part of existence, only feared because of their feud with Spider, a feud you ultimately resolved.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-BLACK_093.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001-B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "I used to play here as a kid, but to the Scholomari, Shadow Magic is a tool and a Shadow School is a reminder of the mortality they forsook.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-BLACK_094.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001-B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Now their only school is over there...",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-BLACK_095.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001-B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "And that is a lot more about indoctrination.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-BLACK_096.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001-B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Yeah, those would likely be children the Scholomari abducted. Not too far away from their \"Graduation,\" I'd say.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-BLACK_097.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001-B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "You can't save them, Wizard, but sure, see for yourself.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-BLACK_098.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
